NOTE ON THE NAME. This package is named for its lineage, not to claim it. The
original SlipSolve is ZeyuJin's MATLAB code; SlipSolve-Curve is Xiaoyu Zou's
MATLAB extension of it. This is a Python translation of the latter, and the
"-python" in the distribution name is there to distinguish it from both.
